Retextures the WCC flag to have any of the flags that you can find in the Robot Enrichment section in the main menu, also reference the Market for flag names.
The only exception for names is "Coop Bots Aperture Flag", which contains another skin for the bots not availible in the market.

Note: You need to have the WCC flag equipped, it can be aquired for free by completing the "High Five" achievement, https://theportalwiki.com/wiki/WCC_Flag
